[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0729","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0729.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0994","title":"OpenBSD fstat 格式字符串本地权限提升漏洞","description":"tags.<value>OpenBSD 2.x 系统中的 fstat 程序存在格式字符串漏洞，由于程序在处理 PWD 环境变量时未正确过滤用户输入，导致本地攻击者可通过向 PWD 变量传递特制的格式字符串触发该漏洞。成功利用后攻击者可获取 root 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.x 系列版本，也可能影响其他基于 BSD 的操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。OpenBSD 官方已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0994"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:55.937","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD 至 3.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，限制非信任用户的本地登录权限，并移除 fstat 程序的 suid 标志位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/fstat）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97068555106135&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1746","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5338","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20256","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0994.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0994","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0994.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0ebf8eac5e6d2af2400b71f0ba35608811c9cff6/references/CVE-2000-0994-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0994.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9ab7f615fa197c3d4aa5deb3277be237fd967af8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-6xrp-2jm3-h54w/GHSA-6xrp-2jm3-h54w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0994.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--36d29821-6fbb-4d91-a6a7-6c795adfeb2c.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0729.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0728","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0728.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0993","title":"BSD libutil 库 pw_error 函数本地格式化字符串权限提升漏洞","description":"BSD libutil 库中的 pw_error 函数存在格式化字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在 chpass 或 passwd 等命令中提交特制的畸形密码字符串触发该漏洞，导致以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 BSD 系统版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0993"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:55.813","remediation":"安装对应 BSD 发行版的安全补丁：OpenBSD 2.7 用户需应用 pw_error 格式字符串漏洞补丁或升级至 2.8 及以上版本；FreeBSD 用户安装 FreeBSD-SA-00:58 补丁；NetBSD 用户安装 NetBSD-SA2000-015 补丁。临时缓解措施：移除 chpass、passwd 等调用 pw_error 函数的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/chpass /usr/bin/passwd），但此操作将影响普通用户修改密码的正常功能。根本修复方案是在 libutil 库的 pw_error 函数中，将所有直接传递用户可控字符串给 printf 风格格式化输出的调用（如 syslog、vwarn）改为使用 %s 格式化占位符，防止格式字符串注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97068555106135&w=2","http://www.openbsd.org/errata27.html#pw_error","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1744","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5339","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/243","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0993.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0993","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0993.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0993.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c41dc6cb54d1e5d50b42eba66ed2d5c23e83378b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qw7m-3wrp-h96f/GHSA-qw7m-3wrp-h96f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0993.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0728.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0727","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0727.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0992","title":"OpenSSH scp 目录遍历任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 1.2.x 的 scp 组件存在目录遍历漏洞，恶意的远程 scp 服务器可通过在文件名中包含 ..（点点）路径分隔符，向客户端文件系统任意位置写入文件，覆盖已有文件。攻击者需诱骗客户端连接至恶意 scp 服务器，从而在内网或用户环境中实现任意文件覆盖，可能导致权限提升或服务异常。此漏洞影响 OpenSSH 1.2 系列版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0992"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:55.680","remediation":"升级至 OpenSSH 2.3.0 及以上版本（或最新 OpenSSH 版本），该版本已修复 scp 路径遍历问题。如无法升级，请禁用 scp 命令（sshd_config 中注释掉 subsystem-sftp 并移除 scp 二进制），改用 sftp 进行安全文件传输。此外，在客户端避免使用 `-o StrictHostKeyChecking=no` 连接不可信服务端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0359.html","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2000:057","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1742","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5312","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20253","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0992.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0992","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0992.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0992.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_scp.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vx4v-hfcq-7vw7/GHSA-vx4v-hfcq-7vw7.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2000/CVE-2000-0992","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--28024590-10a1-4ba5-bcfb-0fd1b9924f67.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0727.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0725","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0725.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0991","title":"Hilgraeve HyperTerminal Telnet 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Hilgraeve HyperTerminal 客户端在处理 telnet URL 时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长字符串的恶意 telnet 链接，诱使用户点击触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受影响系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Windows 98、Windows ME 及 Windows 2000 操作系统自带的 HyperTerminal 6.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-079 中发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0991"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:55.553","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-079 提供的补丁程序（KB274729），或通过 Windows Update 获取更新。对于已终止支持的 Windows 98/ME，建议升级至 Windows XP 及以上版本；如无法升级，可在控制面板中卸载或删除 HyperTerminal 组件（hypertrm.exe），并在防火墙中禁用 TCP 端口 23（Telnet），阻止外部对 Telnet URL 协议的调用。使用 SSH 或第三方终端工具替代 HyperTerminal 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1815","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-079","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5387","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20307","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0991.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0991","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0991.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0991.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c32de14d223251fcc47138cf2f2d457787b2173f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-34hw-5cr2-j645/GHSA-34hw-5cr2-j645.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0991.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f7ee247f-8d91-4331-9ff1-b8ac6273adeb.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0725.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0724","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0724.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0989","title":"Intel InBusiness eMail Station 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Intel InBusiness eMail Station 1.04.87 版本的 POP 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者通过向目标服务发送精心构造的超长用户名字段，可触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务，甚至可能以服务权限执行任意命令。攻击无需认证，通过网络即可实施，风险较高。受影响的版本为 Intel InBusiness eMail Station 1.04.87，目前尚无厂商补丁发布。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0989"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:55.287","remediation":"Intel InBusiness eMail Station 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议升级到受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Exchange、Postfix 等）。若暂时无法迁移，可在防火墙上限制对 TCP 110 端口（POP3）的访问来源，仅允许可信内部 IP 连接，同时检查并限制用户名输入长度不超过 64 字节以缓解缓冲区溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0293.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6488","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5414","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20328","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0989.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0989","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0989.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0989.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c32de14d223251fcc47138cf2f2d457787b2173f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4rx4-j98g-fp32/GHSA-4rx4-j98g-fp32.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0989.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0724.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0722","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0722.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0987","title":"Oracle Internet Directory oidldapd 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Oracle Internet Directory 2.0.6 中的 oidldapd 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该组件的 \"connect\" 命令行参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者获取系统特权提升。该漏洞影响 Oracle 8.1.6 及关联组件，CVSS 评分 4.6，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。目前官方尚未发布针对性补丁，建议限制本地用户对 oidldapd 组件的访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0987"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:55.040","remediation":"升级 Oracle Internet Directory 至 Oracle 官方于 2000 年 12 月之后发布的补丁集版本（如 2.0.7 及以上）。对于当前仍在使用该组件的环境，建议直接迁移至最新受支持的 Oracle Internet Directory 版本（如 11g/12c 系列）。作为临时缓解措施，严格限制可执行 oidldapd 的本地用户范围，移除不必要的本地登录权限，并通过操作系统权限控制限制 oidldapd 二进制文件的执行权限仅为 root 或专用服务账户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/140340","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/140709","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5401","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20312","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0987.json","https:/