status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a101200-2.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1789","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20287","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0985.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0985","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0985.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0985.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b80e198eccaa13040dbe03d79f3c9c06085d067/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-97jj-3vjw-4wp9/GHSA-97jj-3vjw-4wp9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0985.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0720.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0718","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0718.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0984","title":"Cisco IOS HTTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 12.0 至 12.1 版本中的 HTTP 服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞，已获得本地访问权限的用户通过向目标设备发送包含 \"?/\" 字符串的特制 URL 请求，可触发 HTTP 服务器崩溃并导致设备重载重启。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS 12.0、12.1 及 12.1x 系列版本，CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至不受影响的 Cisco IOS 版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0984"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:54.663","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.1(5)T 及更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如业务不需要，执行 `no ip http server` 全局命令禁用 HTTP 管理服务，或使用 `ip http access-class` 限制可访问 HTTP 服务的源 IP 地址范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/ioshttpserverquery-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1838","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5412","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20323","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0984.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0984.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0984","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0984.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0984.md","https://github.com/arpitn30/nipper-ng/blob/a344e58392d528c168b74ccda5caa309923fff56/0.11.10/common/report-vulns.c","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/cisco-view-source-dos.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0718.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0718.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0718.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0716","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0716.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0983","title":"Microsoft NetMeeting 远程桌面共享拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft NetMeeting 3.0.1 的远程桌面共享功能存在拒绝服务漏洞，当启用远程桌面共享后，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 NetMeeting 服务端口发送连续的 null 字节数据包，触发目标系统 CPU 占用率飙升，导致服务不可用。该漏洞无需特殊权限即可远程利用，影响 NetMeeting 3.0.1 及 4.4.3385 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0983"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:54.540","remediation":"微软 NetMeeting 已停止支持，建议升级到不含该组件的现代 Windows 版本（Windows 7 及以上）并卸载 NetMeeting。如仍需使用，请在防火墙层面禁用 TCP 端口 1720 和 1731，并在 NetMeeting 中关闭「桌面共享」功能。如非必要，建议直接删除 `conf.exe` 和 `nmcom.dll` 文件以彻底移除组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ273854","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/140341","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1798","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-077","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5368","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20289","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0983","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0983.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0983.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3ph2-3pv3-wjv3/GHSA-3ph2-3pv3-wjv3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--80053f14-6d36-4bbd-a248-3fd0aeffd999.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0983.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0716.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0714","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0714.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0979","title":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/Me 文件共享密码绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/Me 的文件与打印共享服务存在密码验证绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于系统在验证共享级密码时仅比对密码的第一个字符，远程攻击者无需完整密码即可向目标共享资源发送单个字符的密码数据包绕过访问控制。攻击者可利用此漏洞非法访问目标系统上的共享文件与打印机资源。该漏洞影响 Windows 9x 系列操作系统，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0979"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:54.040","remediation":"Windows 9x/Me 已停止支持且无官方补丁，建议立即升级到 Windows 10/11 等受支持版本。无法升级的系统可在网络边界防火墙禁用 SMB 协议 (TCP 139/445) 并设置文件共享强密码（≥8 位混合字符）以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97147777618139&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1780","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-072","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5395","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A996","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20284","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0979.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a787519a95f62cf00a76124a68ca5cfb2e26b6ec/2000/CVE-2000-0979.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2000-0979/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0979","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0979.json","https://github.com/Z6543/CVE-2000-0979/blob/9ee45a29d4441427bd058402b99606a0ba7f88b6/CVE-2000-0979.rb","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/7af8f5cba0896b54f05a0770c724d58dea523d24/2000/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fxp6-5w7j-wg3x/GHSA-fxp6-5w7j-wg3x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_bruteforce_pass.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0979.md","https://github.com/Z6543/CVE-2000-0979"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0714.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0713","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0713.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0977","title":"Oatmeal Studios Mail File 1.10 mailfile.cgi 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"MailFile 1.10 的 mailfile.cgi CGI 程序存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向该脚本发送特制的 POST 请求，在 filename 参数中指定目标服务器上的任意文件路径，并在 email 参数中指定接收邮箱，服务器将该文件内容通过邮件发送至攻击者指定的邮箱地址，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Oatmeal Studios MailFile 1.10 版本，危害等级中等，攻击无需认证，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0977"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53.800","remediation":"MailFile 1.10 厂商已停止维护且无安全补丁，建议立即从服务器删除 mailfile.cgi 脚本或移除整个 MailFile 应用。如不能立即删除，应在 Apache/Nginx 配置中禁止对该脚本的访问（如 deny all），或限制 filename 参数不允许包含 ../ 等路径遍历字符。最彻底的缓解措施是将前端 Web 服务器升级为现代替代方案（如使用安全的多文件上传组件），并确保废弃 CGI 脚本不再部署到生产环境。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0172.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1807","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5358","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20303","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0977","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0977.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wmj9-6vp5-25g7/GHSA-wmj9-6vp5-25g7.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0977.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--11313dda-0f4d-4792-8ef5-0c7326aa7785.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0713.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0713.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0713.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0704","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0704.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0973","title":"cURL curl 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"cURL 及 cURL-SSL 早期版本（curl 早于 6.0-1.1、curl-ssl 早于 6.0-1.2）存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制请求强制触发超长错误消息生成，导致栈缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛使用的 cURL 客户端及依赖其库的应用，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，CVSS 评分 10.0（CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H），属严重级别。攻击者通过发送精心构造的恶意请求触发错误处理路径，利用缓冲区溢出覆盖返回地址或函数指针，实现任意代码执行并完全控制目标系统。cURL 官方已在 6.0-1.1 及 6.0-1.2 版本中修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0973"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53.267","remediation":"升级至 curl 7.4 或更高版本（含 curl-ssl 对应更新版本），该版本已修复长错误消息触发的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层限制 curl 处理的服务器响应长度，避免超长错误消息被传入缓冲区。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0331.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1804","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5374","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20293","https://github.com/curl/curl-www/blob/245bd197493b521edc2f9a005c35c1a1d3e731ff/docs/CVE-2000-0973.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0973","https://github.com/curl/curl/blob/41b4a911234207b7c5271f8147053769570b06e7/docs/VULN-DISCLOSURE-POLICY.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-4g26-v2fv-8g5f/GHSA-4g26-v2fv-8g5f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/RMerl/asuswrt-merlin.ng/blob/2b88ab2e96c95718b0eb9b836590129a06a3dd0b/release/src/router/curl/docs/VULN-DISCLOSURE-POLICY.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0973.md","https://github.com/timothee-chauvin/eyeballvul_data_sources/blob/b02661fb6d8c6235dd8ce9dbbfda673669d89869/osv_data/GIT/CURL-CVE-2000-0973.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0704.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0703","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0703.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0972","title":"惠普 HP-UX crontab 本地任意文件读取漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.00 及 10.20 系统中的 crontab 命令存在不安全的符号链接处理漏洞（CWE-59）。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录下创建指向目标文件的符号链接，利用 crontab -e 选项编辑计划任务时的文件操作缺陷，使 crontab 读取任意系统文件并通过错误信息泄露文件内容。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特权即可利用，但需要本地用户身份访问系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0972"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53.140","remediation":"立即安装 HP 为该漏洞发布的 PHCO_22044 或等效安全补丁包，将 HP-UX 升级至 11i v1 (11.11) 及以上受支持版本。在 /tmp 目录上设置粘滞位（chmod 1777 /tmp），防止非所有者删除或重命名临时文件。通过编辑 /etc/cron.allow 文件将 crontab 使用权限限制为仅授权用户，并移除 /etc/cron.deny 中的通配条目以阻止未授权用户调用 crontab -e。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0317.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5410","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20329","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0972.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0972","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0972.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0972.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x2cg-9rfp-53mf/GHSA-x2cg-9rfp-53mf.json","https://github.com/mitre/cti/blob/ea1adfe1a68ca3dcfe2dd883180b8cf10a988824/capec/2.0/attack-pattern/attack-pattern--fdeff5dd-62e2-43b2-8eea-5e97307cf973.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0972.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-59.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0703.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0703.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0701","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0701.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0971","title":"Avirt Mail 远程拒绝服务及任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Avirt Mail 4.0 及 4.2 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP 服务发送超长的 \"MAIL FROM\" 或 \"RCPT TO\" 命令触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0971"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:53.017","remediation":"Avirt Mail 4.0/4.2 已停止维护，官方不再提供补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Postfix、Exim），并在网络边界防火墙或 IPS 设备上添加规则，限制 SMTP (TCP 25) 端口的 `RCPT TO` 和 `MAIL FROM` 命令字段长度不超过 512 字节，对超长 SMTP 命令直接丢弃，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0301.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5397","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5398","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20311","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b8712ba896f892b31b495bb919cac52eac29a85/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0971","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0971.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3fmr-qqcp-fr3c/GHSA-3fmr-qqcp-fr3c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88536/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152900_153000.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0971.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0701.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0698","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0698.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0967","title":"PHP PHP 3.0/4.0 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHP 3.x 和 4.x 版本中存在格式化字符串注入漏洞，由于程序未能正确过滤用户输入的格式化字符串参数，攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求触发 PHP 错误日志记录功能，将恶意格式化字符串写入错误日志。当错误日志被 PHP 自身的错误处理函数解析时，格式化字符串中的 %n 等特殊标记可被解释执行，导致攻击者能够覆写内存中的任意地址，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 PHP 3.0.16 及 4.0.2 版本，攻击无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0967"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:52.483","remediation":"立即升级至 PHP 4.1.0 或更高版本（该版本修复了格式化字符串注入漏洞）。对于仍运行 PHP 3.x 的系统，必须升级至 PHP 4.1.0+；PHP 4.0.2 及更早版本均受影响。由于 PHP 3/4 已停止安全支持，建议迁移至 PHP 7.4+ 或 PHP 8.x 系列。临时缓解措施：在 php.ini 中设置 log_errors_max_len = 0 并关闭 display_errors，同时在应用层对所有用户输入进行格式化字符串转义。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0204.html","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a101200-1.txt","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-037.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-062.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-088.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-095.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1786","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5359","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20286","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0967","https://github.com/psecio/versionscan/blob/81cee8accd05924b8421db9ed2a867047819d15a/CONTRIBUTING.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0967.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0967.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v3f7-v9wm-vwj3/GHSA-v3f7-v9wm-vwj3.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0967.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/php_log.nasl","https://github.com/fnmsd/awvs_script_decode/blob/ce24b3ea8777c948052eea831b614324fd4b638f/Scripts/XML/PHP_error_logging_format_string_vulnerability.xml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0698.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0698.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0698.toml"}]